WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:06.520
Now, if these people were using MERIDIAN from day one, using a simple cheek swab to get their genetic mix as well as their medical history,

00:06.520 --> 00:13.400
we can identify the best antidepressant medicine for them, which cuts down the ten-month-long, tiresome journey

00:13.400 --> 00:18.920
and multiple doctor visits to just the one, giving them the solution in hand.

00:18.920 --> 00:25.000
Now, this $1.1 billion market isn’t just about medicine. It’s also about wellbeing.

00:25.000 --> 00:31.960
So what we do is take the personal profile of the patient, as well as the resulting antidepressant,

00:31.960 --> 00:38.960
and, using the model, define the most optimized journey for them throughout their time taking the medicine.

00:38.960 --> 00:44.840
Our suggestions, such as diet, the activities to do, and risks, are tailored.

00:44.840 --> 00:52.800
We’ve done extensive research through Reddit and interviews with multiple professionals,

00:52.800 --> 00:58.960
and we’ve found that many people get constantly prescribed the wrong medicine, and that causes severe side effects.

00:58.960 --> 01:05.120
These medical professionals explained to us that the method of approach is trial and error.

01:05.120 --> 01:17.200
On top of this, people spend over $5,000, as well as time spent on medical and transport costs and being away from work.

01:17.200 --> 01:26.760
We can bring that down to just $1,000. Our team is wanting to raise money to build our own kits to send to their home,

01:26.760 --> 01:38.000
and provide all operational costs to make this as simple and efficient as possible for a patient.

01:38.000 --> 01:41.040
Because, as we know, depression is hard, and we want to make it easier. Thanks.
